  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reforestation of Critical Wintering Habitat for Neotropical Migrants V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grantee and partners will plant 140,000 native trees and coffee bushes; enhance or manage at least 695 acres; and contribute to the ongoing protection of 16,557 acres as significant wintering habitat for migratory birds in Ecuador and Peru. Partners will also measure migrant warbler density and habitat use to guide adaptive management for future restoration work.</narrative>
  </description>
